  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "According to BODMAS rule,\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f22f57d0cf5c493280a0ab6b7dbaea9e3fc5b035c6d410d59c2f476043bd03a8.png] \n\nBy interchanging signs + and –, 7 and 6 by one by one option\n\n1) 4 × 7 + 6 – 3 ÷ 1 = 20\n\n4 × 6 - 7 + **3 ÷ 1** = 20\n\n**4 × 6** - 7 + 3 = 20\n\n**24 **- 7 **+ 3 **= 20\n\n27 - 7 = 20\n\n20 = 20\n\n2) 8 × 7 + 5 ÷ 1 – 6 = 17\n\n**8 × 6 **-** 5 ÷ 1** + 7 = 17\n\n**48 - 5 +** 7 = 17 \n\n50 ≠ 17\n\n3) 7 – 6 × 3 + 4 ÷ 1 = 8\n\n 6 + **7 × 3** - **4 ÷ 1 **= 8\n\n**6 + 21 - 4** = 8\n\n23 ≠ 8\n\n4) 7 × 2 – 6 + 4 ÷ 2 = 13\n\n**6 × 2** + 7 - **4 ÷ 2 **= 13\n\n**12 + 7 - 2 **= 13\n\n17 ≠ 13\n\nHence, the **correct answer** is** \"Option 1\".**",
